13) Common Errors & Fixes
•	JWT expired: renew token (login again or use refresh flow)
•	Invalid signature: check JWT_SECRET in .env is identical for signing and verifying
•	Bearer format: must be exactly Authorization: Bearer <token>
•	CORS errors: ensure app.use(cors()) before routes or configure allowed origins
